# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Owned by `ai-platform`, which owns the org's LLM agent and MCP tooling
# (this repo and agent-forge). It has no `-devs`/`-maintainers` split because
# that split only expresses something once the people who push and the people
# who approve are different groups.
#
# A review from an owner is required on every pull request that touches the
# paths below (enforced by the `main-protection` ruleset). Ownership is listed
# most general first; the LAST matching pattern wins, so the specific entries
# further down take precedence.

# Default owner for anything not matched below.
*                                   @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform

# Authentication and credential handling. Changes here decide whose token is
# used and what gets written to a user's keyring or printed to a log.
/src/services/auth/                 @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/src/tools/github/auth/             @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/src/env/                           @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform

# Anything that reaches a network endpoint on a user's behalf, or decides which
# endpoint that is.
/src/gateway/                       @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/src/remote-mcps/                   @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform

# Supply chain and release. A change to these can alter what ends up inside a
# binary that teammates install.
/.github/workflows/                 @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/scripts/build.ts                   @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/package.json                       @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/bun.lock                           @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
/.gitleaks.toml                     @quynhonsemiconductor/ai-platform
